Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:10.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,1 · START WITH THE BUSINESS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:10.00,Title,,0,0,0,,“Build a site for Happy Paws”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:10.00,Body,,0,0,0,,Pet groomer · Northampton · More bookings · Warm and trustworthy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:10.00,Code,,0,0,0,,One Click asks only for missing essentials.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.50,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,2 · SOLVE THE PLANNING GAP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.50,Title,,0,0,0,,From vague idea to clear direction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.50,Body,,0,0,0,,Structure · Content direction · Calls to action · Layout · Brand feel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:16.50,Code,,0,0,0,,One Click prepares the specification before the builder starts.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:23.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,3 · ANONYMOUS BY DESIGN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:23.00,Title,,0,0,0,,A useful brief, no account required
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:23.00,Body,,0,0,0,,The MCP does not save the brief, access accounts or claim a project was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:23.00,Code,,0,0,0,,oneclick_prepare_basic_draft  →  ephemeral · read-only

Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:30.00,Eyebrow,,0,0,0,,4 · NATIVE LOVABLE HANDOFF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:30.00,Title,,0,0,0,,One Click plans. Lovable builds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:30.00,Body,,0,0,0,,The reviewed brief becomes Lovable’s initial project message inside ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:30.00,Code,,0,0,0,,The user approves before external project creation.

